Cortijo de Palsabangon Farm OPC has been recognized by the Agricultural Training Institute as a specialized Coconut Learning Site, adding coconut-focused curriculum to its existing DA-ATI accreditation.

The designation opens the door to new coconut-specific training programs for farmers and students, building on the farm's existing TESDA-registered courses.
